    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Question Category" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add a Questionnaire Category</p>
            <p>Verifies that a new questionnaire category can be added with valid details.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Questionnaire Categories settings. 2. Click "Add" and fill in category name, mapping reference, questionnaire type, and weight. 3. Save the new category.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The questionnaire category should be successfully added.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
